    "HOOK (0–3s): On-screen: \"POV: you're the only 'tech person' in the family and Aunty wants 'just a small website' for her shop.\"\nBODY: Scene 1: Aunty on the phone: \"It's just small. Five pages. You can do it this weekend, abi? I'll pay you later.\" Scene 2: you, nodding, already tired. Scene 3: flashback to last time: logo changes at midnight, \"make it pop\", payment still pending. Scene 4: you smile and send her a link.\nOn-screen text: \"Love your family. Refer them.\"\nCTA: \"Our referral programme launches tomorrow. Follow so you don't miss it.\"",
