    "HOOK (0–3s): \"Starting a website in December? Have these 5 things ready and it'll launch faster.\"\nBODY: \"1. Your logo files: the original, not a screenshot from WhatsApp. 2. Real photos of your team, your premises, your work. Phone photos in good light beat stock photos. 3. A list of your services, and your prices if you show them. 4. Two or three things clients have said about you, with their permission. 5. The WhatsApp number you actually reply on.\nDon't have all five? That's fine, we help with that. But the more you have, the faster we move.\"\nCTA: \"We have 3 December start slots. Link in bio to book a call.\"",
